            "sourcePages": [
              156
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=156"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "verse": 11,
        "text": "וְעַתָּה בַּקְשׁוּ אֶת־דְּבָרָי שַׁחֲרוּם וְתַשְׂכִּילוּ׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "6192105841b28f37ca96c36fe0db4530e94ef36840a387b0c2bfd1ba8e2c1ea8"
      },
      {
        "verse": 12,
        "text": "בָּרָה הִיא הַחָכְמָה וְלֹא תִבֹּל תִּוָּדַע עַל־נְקַלָּה לְאוֹהֲבֶיהָ [וְתִמָּצֵא לִמְבַקְשֶׁיהָ]׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "64b28e85eac664a9180813c52aa18d5e593f8e032de281537b2cbc6322ed0d82"
      },
      {
        "verse": 13,
        "text": "וְתַעֲבֹר לִפְנֵי דוֹרְשֶׁיהָ לְמַעַן יְמַהֲרוּ לְהַכִּירָהּ׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "527684d72743d745e60079e09a002ffac42699cf506e1127b6d4ce260079f32b"
      },
      {
        "verse": 14,
        "text": "כָּל־שׁוֹחֲרָהּ לֹא יִיעָף כִּי יִמְצָאֶהָ יוֹשֶׁבֶת לִפְנֵי שְׁעָרָיו׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "e21ce4a84f05b6b95217d4047b2628119497d84cb20f7fe12b4ab6e17bb1809a"
      },
      {
        "verse": 15,
        "text": "כִּי הֲגוֹת־בָּהּ מִכְלַל הַתְּבוּנָה וְהַשּׁוֹקֵד עָלֶיהָ כְרֶגַע לָבֶטַח יֵשֵׁב׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "3e2c43db7d81bff53d2b42858eb7e05079435fa7715176937657162d9f5d8e0e"
      },
      {
        "verse": 16,
        "text": "כִּי הִיא תְסוֹבֵב וּתְחַפֵּשׂ אֶת־אֲשֶׁר יָקְרוּ לָהּ וּבִנְתִיבוֹת בְּרָצוֹן תוֹפִיעַ לָמוֹ וּבכָל־זְמָמָם תִּתְמְכֵם׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "36bb4f0dd881ce2b915f56b6a8bef46346c7573d1d26bff91b374802204a8900",
        "sourceNotes": [
          {
            "id": "wis-6-16-bet",
            "kind": "unreadablePoint",
            "anchor": "וּבכָל־זְמָמָם",
            "occurrence": 1,
            "letterIndex": 2,
            "mark": "vowel",
            "sourcePages": [
              156
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=156"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "verse": 17,
        "text": "כִּי רֵאשִׁיתָהּ בּקּשׁ מוּסָר בֶּאֱמֶת׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "da792bdd28b6a0ad55ad7e877de0377103ae274a0f1519e0dd566e71059211c8",
        "sourceNotes": [
          {
            "id": "wis-6-17-bet",
            "kind": "unreadablePoint",
            "anchor": "בּקּשׁ",
            "occurrence": 1,
            "letterIndex": 1,
            "mark": "vowel",
            "sourcePages": [
              156
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=156"
          },
          {
            "id": "wis-6-17-qoph",
            "kind": "unreadablePoint",
            "anchor": "בּקּשׁ",
            "occurrence": 1,
            "letterIndex": 2,
            "mark": "vowel",
            "sourcePages": [
              156
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=156"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "verse": 18,
        "text": "וּדְרֹשׁ מוּסָר אַהֲבָה וְאַהֲבָה שְׁמֹר מִצְוֹתֶיהָ וּנְצֹר מִצְוֹת עֲרבּת אַל־מָוֶת׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "9ac561a87769cfb8825ccf07951d71337aaf645d2cb400ee8435e7d05c9f5e4d",
        "sourceNotes": [
          {
            "id": "wis-6-18-resh",
            "kind": "unreadablePoint",
            "anchor": "עֲרבּת",
            "occurrence": 1,
            "letterIndex": 2,
            "mark": "vowel",
            "sourcePages": [
              156
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=156"
          },
          {
            "id": "wis-6-18-bet",
            "kind": "unreadablePoint",
            "anchor": "עֲרבּת",
            "occurrence": 1,
            "letterIndex": 3,
            "mark": "vowel",
            "sourcePages": [
              156
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=156"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "verse": 19,
        "text": "וְאַל־מָוֶת יְקָרֵב לַיָי׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "0e0522cf19f1164c4b32eae93d7ce433074d528c6fc6f10d2ea95c2275636eac"
      },
      {
        "verse": 20,
        "text": "עַל־כֵּן תְּשׁוּקַת חָכְמָה לְמַלְכוּת תּוֹבִיל׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          156
        ],
        "textSHA256": "96cef3b7c364802b83bd31ec42b9943c6508f51c4cf3c7147cceada22d1f6d95"
      },
      {
        "verse": 21,
        "text": "וְלָכֵן מוֹשְׁלֵי עַמִּים אִם־בְּכִסֵּא וְשֵׁבֶט חֶפְצְכֶם הוֹקִירוּ חָכְמָה לְמַעַן תִּמְלְכוּ לְעוֹלָם׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          157
        ],
        "textSHA256": "1bb98f6205f23f803bdfe91a76792a58e6a32f3597e83c975351c4702e5dd88d"
      },
      {
        "verse": 22,
        "text": "וְהַחָכְמָה מה הִיא וְאֵיךְ נוֹצְרָה אַגִּידָה וְלֹא אַסְתִּיר מִכֶּם סוֹד אַךְ רֵאשִׁית מוֹצָאָהּ אֶחְקֹר וְדַעְתָּהּ אֲגַלֶּה וְלֹא אֶטֶּה מִדֶּרֶךְ אֱמֶת׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          157
        ],
        "textSHA256": "b516b70bc70648b6c50ea75b57ac2ea0c17fc8c77f3e4377447c34a318087df4",
        "sourceNotes": [
          {
            "id": "wis-6-22-mem",
            "kind": "unreadablePoint",
            "anchor": "מה",
            "occurrence": 1,
            "letterIndex": 1,
            "mark": "vowel",
            "sourcePages": [
              157
            ],
            "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=157"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "verse": 23,
        "text": "כִּי לֹא אֵלֵךְ בְּמַעְגַּל קִנְאָה צָרַת הָעַיִן אֲשֶׁר אֵין לָהּ חֵלֶק בַּחָכְמָה׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          157
        ],
        "textSHA256": "30f13a8c1aace502b0743d05d951691fb6875005c5f247e991babb69a7a8265a"
      },
      {
        "verse": 24,
        "text": "בִּרְבוֹת חֲכָמִים תְּשׁוּעַת עוֹלָם וּמֶלֶךְ מַשְׂכִּיל אֹשֶׁר הָעָם׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          157
        ],
        "textSHA256": "2eb76a22a594a0f1350aa85396c53434fd9fc0d0a228667c404c440a484e4658"
      },
      {
        "verse": 25,
        "text": "עַל־כֵּן הוּסְרוּ בִדְבָרַי וְתִוָּשֵׁעוּ׃",
        "sourcePages": [
          157
        ],
        "textSHA256": "9cadfc1f7f83424e28869c09dbe3c5705ec2afdff1c9ea5fedb3aaa4692edaca"
      }
